		<title>Anthropic CEO Amodei admits &quot;there&#039;s a huge uncertainty in what&#039;s going to happen next year&quot; days before a record IPO</title>
		<link>https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-ceo-amodei-admits-theres-a-huge-uncertainty-in-whats-going-to-happen-next-year-days-before-a-record-ipo/</link>
					<comments>https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-ceo-amodei-admits-theres-a-huge-uncertainty-in-whats-going-to-happen-next-year-days-before-a-record-ipo/#respond</comments>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Matthias Bastian]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:05:17 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[AI and society]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Artificial Intelligence]]></category>
		<category><![CDATA[Anthropic]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">https://the-decoder.com/?p=42873</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1376" height="768" src="https://the-decoder.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/anthropic_logos-5.png" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="" style="height: auto; margin-bottom: 10px;" decoding="async" /></p>
<p>        Days before what could be the largest IPO in history, Anthropic CEO Dario Amodei called buying compute 'the deepest business dilemma' his company faces. Anthropic's commitments now total nearly $901 billion, and it's still far from clear whether future revenue will justify those costs. The planned IPO is largely meant to serve as a financial buffer against that uncertainty.</p>
<p>The article <a href="https://the-decoder.com/anthropic-ceo-amodei-admits-theres-a-huge-uncertainty-in-whats-going-to-happen-next-year-days-before-a-record-ipo/">Anthropic CEO Amodei admits &quot;there&#039;s a huge uncertainty in what&#039;s going to happen next year&quot; days before a record IPO</a> appeared first on <a href="https://the-decoder.com">The Decoder</a>.</p>
